For SPD question 4C.1 - Not used
For SPD question 4C.1.2 - Please provide details of one contract completed within the last three years that demonstrate your relevant experience in delivering recruitment services for deliberative engagement, citizens' assemblies, citizens' panels, people's panels, public participation exercises or similar projects.
Please provide:
- Client name and organisation;
- A description of the services provided;
- The methodology used to recruit participants, including any random selection, sortition or stratified sampling approaches;
- The steps taken to achieve a representative sample of the target population;
- Any challenges encountered and how these were addressed;
- The outcomes achieved, including evidence of successful recruitment against agreed demographic targets; and
- Contact details for a referee who may be approached for verification.
Bidders should demonstrate experience of recruiting participants from diverse demographic groups and delivering recruitment exercises that support deliberative engagement and informed public participation.
Failure to provide an example which demonstrate the relevant experience will result in the bidder’s submission being rejected.
